 <title>The Io\Poll\FailedPollOperationException class</title>
 <titleabbrev>Io\Poll\FailedPollOperationException</titleabbrev>

 <partintro>
  <section xml:id="io-poll-failedpolloperationexception.intro">
   &reftitle.intro;
   <simpara>
    The abstract base class of the exceptions thrown when an operation of the
    polling backend fails.
    The exception code tells the reason of the failure and is one of the
    constants of this class.
   </simpara>
  </section>

